# The operator app is private: every route but /auth and /set-password is behind sign-in.
# Nothing here should ever be listed by a search engine, on any host (app.leadfinderos.com
# or the legacy pages.dev address). See src/components/SEOHead.tsx.
#
# CACHING (2026-11-07, src/lib/staleChunk.ts): every page (index.html, served for every route) and sw.js is no-cache,
# so a deploy is picked up on the next load. The hashed files under /assets never change once built, so they keep a
# long cache ("! Cache-Control" drops the no-cache from the rule above before setting their own).
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
